# Riftbound Assets - Animations
# Place animation data files here

# Animation formats supported by Ursina:
# - .anim (Ursina native)
# - Embedded in .obj/.fbx models

# Fighter animations:
# idle.anim
# walk.anim
# jump.anim
# light_attack.anim
# medium_attack.anim
# heavy_attack.anim
# launcher.anim
# hitstun.anim
# block.anim
# ko.anim

# Each animation file contains:
# - Frame timing
# - Bone/keyframe transforms
# - Loop settings
